        "text": "1 Cream sugar with shortening. Add slightly beaten egg yolks.   2 Sift dry ingredients; add to creamed mixture. Add flavoring. 3 Roll in balls then in sugar and flatten out. Bake 7 to 10 minutes at 350 degrees."
